WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.825
Each percentage is of a different amount.

2
00:00:03.477 --> 00:00:06.577
Twenty percent off two hundred leaves one sixty.

3
00:00:09.934 --> 00:00:13.059
Thirty percent off in one step is one forty.

4
00:00:14.135 --> 00:00:17.435
Ten percent off one sixty is one forty-four.
